%% Stage: Phase 4+ (drift 检测对应 ADR-004 Tier 3)
%% Last reviewed: 2026-04-25
%%{init: {'theme':'default'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Plan as Planner
    participant FM as fs.FileManager
    participant Eng as Template Engine
    participant Lock as .linctl/lock.yaml

    Note over Plan,Lock: ====== Drift 检测算法 ======

    Plan->>Eng: Render(template) + Format
    Eng-->>Plan: newContent
    Plan->>Plan: newHash = sha256(newContent)

    Plan->>FM: Read(dst)
    alt 文件不存在
        Plan->>Plan: Action = Create
    else 文件存在
        FM-->>Plan: diskBytes
        Plan->>FM: ExtractEmbeddedHash(diskBytes)

        alt 无 hash comment
            Note right of Plan: 用户拥有的文件<br/>linctl 不动它
            Plan->>Plan: Action = Skip<br/>(reason: no_hash_comment_user_owned)
        else 有 hash comment (embeddedHash)
            Plan->>Plan: diskBodyHash = sha256(strip(diskBytes))

            alt diskBodyHash != embeddedHash
                Note right of Plan: 用户改过文件
                Plan->>Plan: Action = Conflict<br/>(reason: user_modified)
            else diskBodyHash == embeddedHash
                Note right of Plan: 文件未被人改过

                alt diskHash == newHash
                    Plan->>Plan: Action = Skip<br/>(reason: unchanged)
                else
                    Plan->>Plan: Action = Update<br/>(reason: template_updated)
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Plan->>Lock: 读 lock.yaml 获取 owner / 历史 hash
    Note over Lock: 用于 3-way merge<br/>和 prune 决策

    Plan-->>Plan: 输出 Action

    Note over Plan,Lock: ====== 3-way merge 触发 (--strategy=merge) ======

    rect rgba(255,200,200,0.3)
        Note over Plan,Lock: 当 Action = Conflict 且 strategy = merge
        Plan->>Lock: 读 base content (embeddedHash 对应的历史渲染)
        Plan->>Plan: Merge3(base, currentDisk, newRender)
        alt 无冲突
            Plan->>Plan: 输出合并结果
        else 有冲突
            Plan->>Plan: 生成 git-style conflict markers
        end
    end
